    - id: home
      label: HOME, WITH THE LAMP LIT
      point: {x: 6, y: 0, z: 13}
      shape: 10
      speaker: RENZO
      line: The lamp's lit. Mother's inside. I could walk in. It wouldn't change
        anything.
      beatId: 
      radius: 2.2
      figurePath: []
      lanternLine: []
    - id: thread
      label: AIKO'S RED THREAD
      point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 15}
      shape: 3
      speaker: RENZO
      line: Tied round the post, where she tied it every night. So she'd find her
        way back.
      beatId: 
